e World\u2019s Largest Aviation Celebration in Oshkosh, WI every year.  Learn more at www.eaa.org. \n\"", "short_description": "Take flight with EAA\u2019s 360 and virtual reality videos."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://www.eaa.org/en/eaa/privacypolicy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "http://www.eaa.org/en/eaa/privacypolicy", "publisher_name": "Experimental Aircraft Association, Inc.", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://www.eaa.org/", "category": "ENTERTAINMENT", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": null, "genres": ["EXPLORATION", "EDUCATIONAL", "MOVIE", "ADVENTURE"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED_FOR_DOWNLOAD", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": [], "supported_player_modes": [], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "419676289952632"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162706_1843189345708008_2900385758516871168_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xAwTEoKTH3cQ7kNvwHNU5Qf&_nc_oc=Ado4MB4uU6TV34I8aA3pwYwzzXey8olZl4-9MmBq8hCkpWImW9ENdo7tpElHFxtoyBU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af3CZGzIuy1H4t59AIiyfNWWtx69Tsc4in1NVye1YLh-TQ&oe=69D25675"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "EAA 360", "platform": "ANDROID", "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "release_date": 1505926002, "lastRevision": {"nodes": [{"id": "1225065620971934", "release_type": "SCHEDULED", "administration_status": "APPROVED", "pdp_metadata": {"application": {"default_locale": "en_US", "id": "1441572095934452", "is_first_party": false, "en